# Machine-local DCS backup, written by qt_ui/liberation_install.py
# replace_mission_scripting_file() from *your* DCS install on launch. It is not
# source: tracking it pushed one machine's DCS state to everyone, and the copy
# upstream shipped was a stale Retribution replacement (sanitizeModule calls
# commented out), so "Restore original" wrote a DESANITIZED file back to DCS.
# Untracked so each install captures its own faithful stock backup.
resources/scripts/MissionScripting.original.lua
